  "details": "Observation:\n\nI wanted to share an observation regarding the Unity 6 beta. When visiting a certain world, I noticed a difference in the mesh collider positions compared to the current Live build.\n\nWorld Link:\n\nWorld: -yuuri-憩いの島\n\nAuthor: o_ゆうり_o \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_f8f0c2b8-7d9f-4189-846f-3899ea860a8f\n\nDetails:\n\nJust to clarify what is happening, in the Unity 6 version, the avatar is clipping into the intended collider due to this positional difference.\n\nAttachments:\n\nI have attached screenshots for comparison:\n\nImage 1: Current Live build\n\nImage 2: Unity 6 version (showing the avatar clipping)",
